    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but how can i reclaim anything? everything is set in stone. everything i do is pre-determined by them. it feels like no matter what i do, i'm just playing a role in a script i didn't write. there's no way to actually change my life without breaking everything they've built. it just feels like there's no way out that doesn't hurt everyone.",
