      "content": "small acts of defiance don't change the fact that i'm still here, still stuck in their world. it's not like i can just walk away and start over. i'm tied to all of this. sometimes i just wish i could find some kind of real escape... like, something that actually works to make the noise stop forever. something that lets me finally be free of all this weight.",
